    "### 3. 上下文优化\n",
    "\n",
    "**动态上下文长度**：根据问题复杂度调整\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "def dynamic_context_length(question, max_length=2000):\n",
    "    # 简单问题使用较短上下文\n",
    "    if is_simple_question(question):\n",
    "        return min(512, max_length)\n",
    "    # 复杂问题使用较长上下文\n",
    "    elif is_complex_question(question):\n",
    "        return min(2000, max_length)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        return 1024\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**上下文去重**：避免重复信息\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "def remove_duplicates(documents):\n",
    "    seen = set()\n",
    "    unique_docs = []\n",
    "    for doc in documents:\n",
    "        doc_hash = hash(doc['content'])\n",
    "        if doc_hash not in seen:\n",
    "            seen.add(doc_hash)\n",
    "            unique_docs.append(doc)\n",
    "    return unique_docs\n",
    "```"
   ]
